From 1111111111111111111111111111111111111111 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mini2 Integration <mini2@example.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Mini2 thermal: firmware-only integration (UART, PG, init/process)

Adds Mini2 control (palette/zoom + optional FFC hooks) over UART, parameter
group, init hook, and AUX task processing. No Configurator changes.

